WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
01 / START WITH THE OPERATING PICTURE
Bookings, reporting history, and demand signals in the original dashboard.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
02 / CHECK BOOKING PACE
A fictional listing shows occupancy, booking pace, and proposed moves.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
03 / EXPLAIN THE MOVE AND CAP IT
Demand suggests $420. The $360 ceiling caps the proposal at +20%.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
04 / LET THE OPERATOR DECIDE
Review the proposed price and its reasoning before authorizing a change.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
05 / RECORD THE OUTCOME
The sample change log records the approved move and the operator.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.000
OR / LEAVE A PROPOSAL PENDING
No decision, no authorized price change. The proposal remains available.

